# This folder holds the extension's marketplace icon.
#
# Required file:  media/icon.png   (128x128 px PNG, used by package.json "icon" field)
#
# The actual icon.png must be added manually by the developer before publishing
# to the VS Code Marketplace. `vsce package` will fail with a "File not found"
# error until icon.png exists — that is expected.
#
# The sidebar activity-bar icon (media/sidebar.svg) is committed alongside
# this placeholder.
